  book_index: 8
  book_title: 'Part I: The Extra Page'
  book_color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  book_clue_index: 109
  content: 
  clue_content: "The extra page appeared between the plumbers and the printers. Numbered
    416\xBD, it listed memory repair shops, a school on Mars, and people not yet
    born.\r\n\u201CPrinter\u2019s joke,\u201D her supervisor said. \u201CSix calls
    waiting.\u201D\r\nAfter midnight, Mara dialled the only number without a name.\r\n\u201CPlease
    don\u2019t disconnect,\u201D a woman said. \u201CThis number was in my great-grandmother\u2019s
    diary.\u201D\r\n\u201CWhat was her name?\u201D\r\n\u201CMara.\u201D"
